# IL2-IL5, oracle expected_ball at N=5. Real log(1)=0 gives exact printable text.
prec 5
Log (1 ; 4 * [1 mod 9])
logabs (-1 ; 4 * [1 mod 9])
log_abs (-1 ; 4 * [1 mod 9])
Log_at (1 ; 4 * [1 mod 9]) with 3
Log_at (1 ; 4 * [1 mod 9]) with 5
Log_at (1 ; 4 * [1 mod 9]) with 2
Log_at (1 ; 1 * [1 mod 2]) with 2
Log_at (1 ; 3 * [-1]) with 3
Log_at (1 ; 1/3 * [1 mod 9]) with 3
Log_at (1 ; 4 * [1 mod 9]) with real
log_abs_at (-1 ; 4 * [1 mod 9]) with real
Log (1 ; 1 * [1])
